rules:
- RULE-SET,rf_Gemini,RF·🧠 Gemini
- RULE-SET,rf_AI,RF·🤖 AI
- RULE-SET,rf_YouTube,RF·📺 YouTube
- RULE-SET,rf_Netflix,RF·🎬 Netflix
- RULE-SET,rf_DisneyPlus,RF·🏰 DisneyPlus
- RULE-SET,rf_Google,RF·🇬 Google
- RULE-SET,rf_GitHub,RF·🐙 GitHub
- DOMAIN,login.live.com,RF·🚀 节点选择
- DOMAIN,logincdn.msauth.net,RF·🚀 节点选择
- RULE-SET,rf_Microsoft,RF·🪟 Microsoft
- RULE-SET,rf_Apple,RF·🍎 Apple
- RULE-SET,rf_Telegram,RF·✈️ Telegram
- RULE-SET,rf_PayPal,RF·💳 PayPal
- RULE-SET,rf_GlobalMedia,RF·🎞️ 境外流媒体
- RULE-SET,rf_GlobalSites,RF·🌐 境外网站
- RULE-SET,rf_Domestic,RF·🇨🇳 国内应用
- GEOSITE,private,DIRECT
- GEOIP,LAN,DIRECT,no-resolve
- GEOIP,CN,DIRECT,no-resolve
- MATCH,RF·🐟 漏网之鱼
